  {
    "id": "2050875242642337867",
    "created_at": "2026-05-03 05:48:55 -04:00",
    "full_text": "Great article! Though you forgot to mention the most interesting part. The staking yield will not just be reduced but actually turn negative beyond a point. \n\nYou will lose money when staking ETH, which is great because it will incentivise people to just hold ETH instead of holding derivatives like stETH.\n\nThis is exactly the kind of incentive we need for the long-term security of Ethereum. 🙌",
